== Effects ==
* Gives Isaac two {{e|Key}}s.
* If a non-{{e|Red Chest}} spawns [[hearts]], [[coins]], {{e|Bomb}}s and/or {{e|Key}}s, causes the chest to spawn a second group of said pickups, effectively doubling the average pickup yield.
* {{transformation contribution|Yes Mother?}}

== Notes ==
* Mom's Key cannot change the contents of a chest; it will only cause it to spawn extra pickups.
* All other chest rewards (such as [[pill]]s, [[card]]s, [[item]]s, etc.) will not cause the chest to spawn additional pickups.
* {{dlc|r}} Does not affect {{e|Old Chest|n}}s.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Sharp Key}}: Doubles the amount of pickups dropped by enemies.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Mom's Key}}: Does not further increase the amount of pickups spawned when multiple copies of the item are acquired.

